icipal disposal facility.\n* Check your local municipal government or sanitation department website for their specific guidelines.\n\n### Temporary Measures\nIf you cannot bury or take your pet to a clinic immediately:\n* Wrap the body in a paper towel or small cloth, place it in a sealed, airtight plastic bag (like a Ziploc), and keep it in a cold, dry place. \n* If you need to wait more than a few hours, place the sealed bag in a refrigerator or freezer until you can make final arrangements, as this prevents odor and decomposition.",
